WEBVTT

00:09:59.769 --> 00:10:02.547
That's how we change systems.

00:10:02.571 --> 00:10:04.682
By opening doors so wide

00:10:04.706 --> 00:10:07.348
that people can't help but walk in.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.825
So what's stopping you

00:10:09.849 --> 00:10:13.769
from bringing participatory budgeting
to your community?